  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#930\">各式燈籠！</span></strong></span><br>這個模組新增了 <strong>9</strong> 種具有特殊模型和有趣小功能的燈籠。<br>未來將會加入更多燈光以及與其他模組的整合。<br><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/ebb7b971673d6833ca28631a0b850dd3.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br><strong>更多截圖：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/33c061931b644436179d90012df60158.png\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">參與模組創作！你可以將自己的燈籠加入模組中。加入 Discord 傳送你的燈籠並接收模板。</span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 也可以提交你使用此模組建造的建築，它們將被添加到模組畫廊中。</span></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/0b66ce3133c9dbcf77fbd8bb3e9a7176.png\" width=\"678\" height=\"339\"><br><br></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/RPGSMW\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 使用優惠碼 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/RPGSMW\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPGSMW</a>&nbsp;首次購買可享&nbsp;25%&nbsp;折扣！</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br></span><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZcETyCwHxV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/3ecf9dd3ff97576f8640833966810a56.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></p>",
